{"id":"7d7f8d86e59118838606c5e439e0150eea4ee33b","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1245629","title":"感觉现在的 codex 已经 gemini 化了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"lurenjiauser","excerpt":"OpenAI - @lurenjiauser - 你跟他说一个名词，他就立即顺着说这个好。说完了，你冷冷对他说，你自己看看你说得对不对？他立刻开始打自己脸。打完脸后你再质问一下，又接着打。已经完全没有那种全局深思的 opus/","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>你跟他说一个名词，他就立即顺着说这个好。</p>\n<p>说完了，你冷冷对他说，你自己看看你说得对不对？他立刻开始打自己脸。</p>\n<p>打完脸后你再质问一下，又接着打。</p>\n<p>已经完全没有那种全局深思的 opus/fable 风格了。</p>\n<p>改代码也非常慢，非常慢。</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/局限\"><li></li> 局限</a><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a></P><p><span>7 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-30 08:41:49 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139217\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0d85/ea07/193063_normal.png?m=1784085579\" alt=\"aaxx2xx\" data-uid=\"193063\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aaxx2xx\">aaxx2xx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:45:25 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>网页版也已经流口水了，只要你否定它一句话，它立马顺着你的意思一直往下编</p><p>“我现在反而推荐你 XXX”</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139233\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/54fd/a4b5/488551_normal.png?m=1685869095\" alt=\"gpen\" data-uid=\"488551\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpen\">gpen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 20:54:39 +08:00\">1 day ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没错，事后道歉，在你指出问题之后说的头头是道的。但是下次该错还是错。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139314\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 21:33:32 +08:00\">1 day ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用着还好吧，Gemini 那套确实挺恶心，</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139345\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fed6/d910/92455_normal.png?m=1749100411\" alt=\"Felldeadbird\" data-uid=\"92455\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Felldeadbird\">Felldeadbird</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 21:51:57 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你说的对，我不应该顺着你说我不对，我就千依百顺的改正。<br>接下来你说怎样我就怎样。<br>我这里有一百种回帖方式，你需要吗？需要的话我马上给你。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18139548\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca8de5ce310c84ec0abf08eb3f12b068?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tory12138\" data-uid=\"818002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n  